OL,5,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,6,     FIn Weston-super-Mare a massive
OL,7,     Fdemolition machine needs to be
OL,8,     Fdismantled and then transported on
OL,9,     Ffive separate trucks to a disused
OL,10,     Fpower station 240 miles away in
OL,11,     FNorth Yorkshire.
OL,12,G0300 Trucking Heavy
OL,13,     FA vintage steam locomotive worth
OL,14,     F#250,000 is hauled from the Peak
OL,15,     FDistrict to its new home in
OL,16,     FCornwall, negotiating tight roads,
OL,17,     Fhill climbs and impatient road
OL,18,     Fusers along the way.
